## 2. Modularity & Dependency Structure

- Strict File Line Limit: 100% of all 8,083 source files contain <= 256 lines (RULES.oot Section 1.8).
- Academy Headers: Every file begins with Title, Logline, Setup, and Beats.
- DAG Dependency Integrity: Analysis confirms a Directed Acyclic Graph across 2,037 nodes with 0 cycles.

